§§ `Abetment fixtures -- sections 111, 113 and 114`

-- Illustration (a) to s 111: the child poisons Y's food instead of Z's, a probable consequence of the instigation.
`instigation where a different act was done` MEANS Abetment WITH
    `instigates any person to do the thing` IS TRUE
    `engages with one or more other persons in a conspiracy for the doing of the thing` IS FALSE
    `an act or illegal omission takes place in pursuance of that conspiracy and in order to the doing of that thing` IS FALSE
    `intentionally aids by any act or illegal omission the doing of the thing` IS FALSE
    `the thing would be an offence if committed by a person capable of committing an offence with the same intention or knowledge as the abettor` IS TRUE
    `the abetment takes place in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the act abetted would be committed outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the act abetted would constitute an offence if committed in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the offence abetted would be committed in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `any or all of the acts constituting the abetment were done outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `facts unknown to the abettor make the doing of the thing impossible` IS FALSE
    `a different act from the act abetted was done` IS TRUE
    `the act done was a probable consequence of the abetment` IS TRUE
    `the act done was committed under the influence of the instigation or with the aid or in pursuance of the conspiracy which constituted the abetment` IS TRUE
    `the act was abetted with the intention on the part of the abettor of causing a particular effect` IS FALSE
    `an act for which the abettor is liable in consequence of the abetment causes a different effect from that intended` IS FALSE
    `the abettor knew that the act abetted was likely to cause that effect` IS FALSE
    `the abettor was present when the act or offence for which he would be punishable was committed` IS FALSE

-- Illustration (b) to s 111: B burns the house as instigated and also steals. The theft is a distinct act, not a probable consequence, so s 111 does not reach it.
