§§ `Hurt fixtures -- Chapter 16, sections 319 to 338`

-- ss 319 and 321: bodily pain caused, with the intention of causing hurt.
`a punch causing pain` MEANS `Bodily Harm` WITH
    `causes bodily pain to any person` IS TRUE
    `causes disease to any person` IS FALSE
