    `in order that such person may be subjected or so disposed of as to be put in danger of being subjected to grievous hurt or slavery or to non-consensual penile penetration of the anus or mouth or knowing it to be likely that such person will be so subjected or disposed of` IS FALSE
    `knowing that any person has been kidnapped or has been abducted wrongfully conceals or keeps such person in confinement` IS FALSE
